%%{init: {'flowchart': {'curve': 'linear'}} }%%
flowchart TB
    S([Start]) --> A[Open Add Expense Screen]
    A --> B[Enter Expense Details]
    B --> C{Internet Available?}

    C -->|Yes| D[Call Backend Create Expense API]
    C -->|No| E[Save Expense in Local Storage]

    D --> F{API Success?}
    F -->|Yes| G[Update Expense List]
    F -->|No| H[Show Error Message]

    E --> I[Add to Offline Sync Queue]
    I --> J[Show Saved Offline Message]
    J --> G

    G --> K[Trigger Notification Flow]
    K --> L[Show Success Message]

    H --> M([End])
    L --> M
